  "summary": "Added an allowlisted pipeline_log diagnostics tail target and Activity/Raw tail display modes for Pipeline Log surfaces.",
  "reason": "Operators need a true raw pipeline_debug.log tail option when the default Pipeline Log activity view compacts repeated progress lines and appends active-work evidence.",
  "affected_areas": [
    "api",
    "diagnostics",
    "docs",
    "tests",
    "webview"
  ],
  "behavior_before": "The Pipeline Log floating panel and standalone window rendered the diagnostics log_tail from /api/diagnostics with progress-line compaction plus synthesized active-work evidence. The allowlisted diagnostics tail reader did not expose pipeline_debug.log directly.",
  "behavior_after": "The backend exposes resolved.log_file through the allowlisted pipeline_log target for /api/diagnostics/tail and /api/diagnostics/open. Pipeline Log surfaces default to the existing Activity view but can switch to Raw tail, which reads the pipeline_log tail endpoint and renders the returned text without compaction or active-work injection.",
